---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import heroPortrait from '../assets/images/sven-hero.jpg';
import bookCover from '../assets/images/book-cover-nonlinear.png';
import { site } from '../data/site';

// The site's single photograph. Astro generates responsive WebP sizes at build time.
// object-position keeps Sven at the centre of the 4:5 crop of the landscape original.

const situations = [
  {
    n: '01',
    title: 'The decisions that keep coming back',
    body: 'You have discussed the issue repeatedly. Everyone understands the problem. Yet the decision keeps getting postponed, diluted or reversed. By now the useful question is why the organisation cannot resolve it.',
    indent: 'md:ml-0',
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    title: 'When the leadership team becomes the bottleneck',
    body: 'The people around the table are capable. But responsibilities overlap, disagreements stay unresolved and too many decisions still return to the CEO. The work is to understand what is happening between the people as well as within them.',
    indent: 'md:ml-[16.666%]',
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    title: 'When the business outgrows the founder',
    body: 'The company has scaled. The way decisions are made, responsibilities are shared and leadership operates may not have changed with it. The founder has to work out what to keep, what to let go of and what the next version of their role must look like.',
    indent: 'md:ml-[33.333%]',
  },
];

const pillars = [
  {
    title: 'Entrepreneurial experience',
    body: 'Four years building MaterFly, the venture in women\'s mental health that became Dana, then founding Kuma Partners. I know what it is to carry full responsibility for a company, including the parts that never reach the pitch deck.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Executive and international practice',
    body: 'More than 100 founders and C-suite leaders guided across Europe, in English, Spanish, German and French. I grew up between languages and institutions in Brussels, which still shapes how I read a leadership team.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Research and governance',
    body: 'Research collaborator of IESE Business School since a 2015 case study with Prof. Iñigo Gallo. Today I study how founders with non-linear cognitive profiles lead and govern, with Prof. Thomas Kluetter (IESE) and Prof. Nicolas Deuschel (IE Business School).',
  },
];

const steps = [
  { n: '01', t: 'Bring the real issue', b: 'We start with the decision, conflict or transition that is actually occupying your attention.' },
  { n: '02', t: 'Understand what is underneath', b: 'We examine the assumptions, power dynamics, incentives and structural friction shaping the situation.' },
  { n: '03', t: 'Challenge your thinking', b: 'We test uncomfortable options, pressure-test blind spots and name what is being avoided.' },
  { n: '04', t: 'Decide what happens next', b: 'You leave with clarity of judgement and a concrete action to take forward.' },
];
---
<Layout>
  <!-- 1 · Hero
       md and up: text column 5/12 (about 42%), photo 7/12 (about 58%), photo shown in its natural landscape ratio.
       Mobile: DOM order gives eyebrow, headline, photo, supporting text, then the call to action. -->
  <!-- Hero backdrop: a barely perceptible diagonal from warm cream to gallery grey -->
  <section class="bg-linear-to-tr from-[#FAF9F6] via-[#F5F4EE] to-[#ECEAE6]">
  <div class="container-x pt-14 md:pt-20 lg:pt-28 pb-20 md:pb-24 lg:pb-28">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-x-10 lg:gap-x-14 md:items-center">
      <div class="md:col-span-5 md:row-start-1 md:self-end max-w-[27.5rem]">
        <p class="label text-steel">Executive advisory · Founders and CEOs</p>
        <h1 class="mt-6 md:mt-8 display text-[2.75rem] sm:text-5xl md:text-[2.6rem] lg:text-[3.6rem] xl:text-[4rem] text-balance">A thinking partner for the decisions you cannot delegate.</h1>
      </div>

      <figure class="mt-10 md:mt-0 md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2">
        <div class="relative aspect-[3/2] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl lg:rounded-[1.75rem] border border-ink/5 bg-mist shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.05)]">
          <Image
            src={heroPortrait}
            alt="Sven Mulfinger, executive advisor to founders and CEOs."
            widths={[480, 720, 960, 1256]}
            sizes="(min-width: 768px) 58vw, 100vw"
            format="webp"
            quality={82}
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
            class="absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover object-center"
          />
        </div>
        <figcaption class="mt-2 text-[11px] tracking-wide text-steel/80">Dr. Sven Mulfinger</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="mt-8 md:mt-8 md:col-span-5 md:row-start-2 md:self-start max-w-[27.5rem] space-y-8">
        <p class="text-lg lg:text-xl text-steel leading-relaxed">I work with founders and CEOs when decisions get harder, leadership dynamics become more complicated or the business demands a different kind of leadership.</p>
        <div>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap bg-ink text-paper px-7 md:px-5 lg:px-7 py-4 text-sm hover:bg-ink-hover transition-colors">Discuss a leadership challenge <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-steel">Confidential. Direct. No obligation to continue.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 · Situations -->
  <section class="border-t border-line bg-linear-to-br from-[#FAF9F6] via-[#F7F6F1] to-[#EFEDE8]" aria-labelledby="situations-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-24 md:py-32">
      <p class="label text-steel">Where the work starts</p>
      <h2 id="situations-heading" class="mt-6 display text-4xl md:text-6xl max-w-[18ch] text-balance">The problems that bring CEOs to the table.</h2>
      <div class="mt-16 md:mt-24 space-y-16 md:space-y-20">
        {situations.map((s) => (
          <article class:list={['max-w-[44rem] border-t border-ink pt-6', s.indent]}>
            <p class="label text-steel">{s.n}</p>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-[1.75rem] md:text-[2.1rem] leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em]">{s.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-steel leading-relaxed">{s.body}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 · Background -->
  <section class="bg-mist border-y border-line" aria-labelledby="background-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <p class="label text-steel">Background</p>
          <h2 id="background-heading" class="mt-6 display text-4xl md:text-6xl">I have sat on both sides of the table.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 lg:pt-16 font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl leading-snug text-ink">I trained in molecular genetics and chemical engineering and hold a doctorate. I have founded and built companies and carried the decisions that come with them. That is the experience I bring when a founder or CEO has a hard call to make.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-16 md:mt-20 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-x-12 gap-y-12">
        {pillars.map((p) => (
          <div class="border-t border-ink pt-6">
            <h3 class="text-2xl leading-tight">{p.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-steel leading-relaxed">{p.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <a href="/about" class="mt-14 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm border-b border-ink pb-1 hover:text-steel hover:border-steel transition-colors">More about my background <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 · Process -->
  <section aria-labelledby="process-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-24 md:py-32">
      <p class="label text-steel">The work</p>
      <h2 id="process-heading" class="mt-6 display text-4xl md:text-6xl max-w-[18ch]">What happens when we work together.</h2>
      <ol class="mt-16 md:mt-20 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-x-10 gap-y-12">
        {steps.map((s) => (
          <li class="border-t border-ink pt-6">
            <p class="font-serif text-4xl text-steel/70">{s.n}</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl leading-snug">{s.t}</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-steel leading-relaxed">{s.b}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5 · Engagement paths -->
  <section class="border-t border-line" aria-labelledby="paths-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-24 md:py-32">
      <p class="label text-steel">Ways to work together</p>
      <h2 id="paths-heading" class="mt-6 display text-4xl md:text-6xl">Three paths, one starting point.</h2>
      <div class="mt-16 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12">
        <article class="lg:col-span-7 bg-ink text-paper p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col">
          <p class="label text-fog">Primary · Individual</p>
          <h3 class="mt-8 display text-4xl md:text-5xl">1:1 Executive Advisory</h3>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/85 max-w-xl">Confidential strategic counsel for individual founders and CEOs. Two sessions a month for 6 or 12 months, in Barcelona, Madrid or online, with direct access in between when a decision cannot wait.</p>
          <div class="mt-auto pt-12">
            <a href="/advisory" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-paper text-ink px-6 py-3.5 text-sm hover:bg-mist transition-colors">How 1:1 advisory works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col">
          <article class="border-t border-ink pt-6 pb-10">
            <p class="label text-steel">Peer group · Barcelona</p>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-3xl">The Round</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-steel leading-relaxed">A private peer collective in Barcelona for founders and CEOs of high-growth companies. Monthly sessions on live issues with people who carry the same weight. By application or nomination.</p>
            <a href="/advisory#the-round" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm border-b border-ink pb-1 hover:text-steel hover:border-steel transition-colors">About The Round <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="border-t border-ink pt-6">
            <p class="label text-steel">Leadership teams</p>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-3xl">Kuma Partners</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-steel leading-relaxed">My institutional practice for leadership team offsites, enterprise operating models and the 14-Day Leadership Friction Diagnostic, run with partners who have led companies themselves.</p>
            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm">
              <a href={site.links.kuma} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-ink pb-1 hover:text-steel hover:border-steel transition-colors">kuma.partners <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span></a>
              <a href={site.links.offsite} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line-strong pb-1 text-steel hover:text-ink hover:border-ink transition-colors">Offsites <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span></a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6 · Research -->
  <section id="research" class="bg-mist border-y border-line scroll-mt-16" aria-labelledby="research-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-24 md:py-32 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <figure class="mx-auto lg:mx-0 max-w-[19rem]">
          <Image
            src={bookCover}
            alt="The Non-Linear Operating System by Dr. Sven Mulfinger"
            widths={[304, 456, 608, 912]}
            sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 304px, 70vw"
            format="webp"
            quality={85}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="block w-full h-auto rounded-sm shadow-2xl"
          />
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6">
        <p class="label text-steel">Research &amp; intellectual property</p>
        <h2 id="research-heading" class="mt-6 display text-3xl md:text-5xl text-balance">Why do some leaders excel at seeing possibilities but struggle with the systems needed to scale them?</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg text-steel leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          <p>Many founders have spiky cognitive profiles: ADHD, giftedness, dyslexia, autism or a combination that never received a label. The same wiring that lets them see around corners shapes how they delegate, decide and handle conflict once the company grows.</p>
          <p><em>The Non-Linear Operating System</em> is a forthcoming work developed in collaboration with Prof. Dr. Thomas Kluetter (IESE Business School) and Prof. Dr. Nicolas Deuschel (IE Business School), grounded in research and field analysis across more than 50 serial entrepreneurs and CEOs operating with a non-linear mind.</p>
        </div>
        <a href={site.links.neurodisruptors} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm border-b border-ink pb-1 hover:text-steel hover:border-steel transition-colors">Explore the research at neurodisruptors.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 8 · Final invitation (section 7 of the brief is the removal of FAQ and slogans) -->
  <section aria-labelledby="invite-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-28 md:py-40 text-center">
      <h2 id="invite-heading" class="display text-4xl md:text-7xl max-w-[16ch] mx-auto text-balance">Bring the decision you have been circling.</h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="mt-12 inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-ink text-paper px-8 py-4 text-sm hover:bg-ink-hover transition-colors">Discuss a leadership challenge <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-steel">Confidential. Direct. No obligation to continue.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
